      "Validated workflow specification LIONESS-PUMA under project policy ef7105d467ee.",
      "Require at least three expression samples and a validated one-ID-per-line miRNA list.",
      "Keep aggregate and sample-specific outputs distinct from every input.",
      "For sample k, LIONESS uses the all-sample PUMA network and the PUMA network recomputed after removing k: N_k = n * N_all - (n - 1) * N_without_k.",
      "An aggregate COBRA adjusted co-expression artifact is not a direct LIONESS handoff; sample-specific COBRA adjustment would need to be recomputed inside each leave-one-out construction.",
      "When a patient or sample identifier is supplied, produce sample-specific networks for all available samples, select the requested sample afterward, and keep it separate from the aggregate network."
